ect box?</div> </div> </div> </div>What this guy said. Are you sure you're logging in in the right place? I had that problem once. It's not a well designed login page, so I bookmarked <i>this</i> link.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/master_backer_accounts\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.backerkit.com/master_backer_accounts</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T23:09:05-07:00","id":1310933,"title":"","content":"Yes. As incompetent as I am with a computer, I do know how to do that at least. And no, it does not work. It has never worked. None of my surveys have ever shown up, and my email is never recognized as having an account.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25297-johandracys","name":"JohanDracys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-09T05:21:40-07:00","id":1310958,"title":"","content":"I got my books and dice yesterday. The books look fantastic. the dice? not so much.<br /> <br /> Am I the first one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https:/